skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
hide footbox

actor "Authenticated requester" as User
participant "DPP service" as DPP #FFF2CC
participant "DPP IAM" as IAM #FFF2CC
participant "AAS service" as AAS #D9EAF7

User -> DPP : Read DPP by product ID\nAccept-Signature (optional)
DPP -> IAM : Authenticate requester
IAM --> DPP : AAS access token for role
DPP -> AAS : Read DPP data with token
AAS -> AAS : Authorize properties for role
AAS --> DPP : DPP data
DPP -> DPP : Sign response only when requested
DPP --> User : DPP data\nContent-Digest + Signature-Input + Signature (when requested)
@enduml
